  "title": "· IN-BAG | Louis Vuitton Unveils Summer Bag Charms: Ice Cream Cones, Cocktails, Hot Air Balloons ·",
  "original_title": "IN-BAG | Louis Vuitton 上市夏日系列包包挂饰：甜筒、鸡尾酒、热气球",
