      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just unveiled its Summer 2026 collection of bag charms and accessories, featuring whimsical shapes like hot air balloons, giant pandas, the Eiffel Tower, and heart-shaped padlocks. The most adorable of all are the ice cream cones 🍦 and signature cocktails 🍹, perfectly capturing the leisurely vibe of a summer getaway.",
