      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The standout piece this season is the LV Sunset Pouch bag charm, inspired by the intoxicating hues of a sunset cocktail. Crafted from gradient rainbow Monogram canvas, it takes the shape of a cocktail glass, topped with a lemon slice and fuchsia umbrella for added realism. But it's not just a charm—it's a zip pouch that can hold your earphones, keys, or other small essentials, making you want to take it along for a drink.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
